What is derived from it, and where:

  css/app.css
      The colour tokens in the two :root blocks are taken from the
      Configurator's src/css/app.css (version 2.3), and the section,
      sub-section and field styles reproduce the layout of its
      Section.svelte, SubSection.svelte and Field.svelte components.

  data/labels-2.3.js
      Setting labels, units and section headings, generated by
      tools/gen_labels.py from the Configurator's tab sources and its English
      locale file (locales/en/messages.json).

  js/schema.js
      The tab list and the grouping of settings into tabs follow the
      Configurator's own organisation.

Material derived from the Rotorflight firmware, also GPL-3.0:

  data/rf-4.5.js, data/rf-4.6.js
      Setting names, scopes, types, ranges, enum values and factory defaults,
      generated by tools/gen_settings.py from the firmware source.

